{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15205150","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15205150","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1520515001:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>. Why are you here?","source_cn":"你。<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x07A5EFAC9BF2E273","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>. Why are you here?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>. Why are you here?","variant_male_record_index":"184976","variant_female_record_index":"184977","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520515002:0":{"text":"Kordan, we're finding a way to deal with the warriors' bodies.","source_cn":"戈丹，战士的遗体需要妥善安葬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFD3D76BFAFC9CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520515003:0":{"text":"The Arcane Council has come up with a solution.","source_cn":"魔法师协会想出了一些办法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34E3B04ACF2E1278","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:6:1520515004:0":{"text":"You tell Kordan about the Wildborn casualties and Morgan's proposed solution to deal with the bodies...","source_cn":"将安葬雅库伯尔战士的事宜，以及摩根的解决方案告诉了戈丹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CF774757EE30C1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520515005:1":{"text":"I won't accept anything other than tree burials!","source_cn":"雅库伯尔必须使用树葬。没得商量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC13F0816F7345827","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520515006:1":{"text":"... Here we go again.","source_cn":"……又来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BAF0DF179D2C865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1520515006":{"text":"... Here we go again.","source_cn":"……又来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BAF0DF179D2C865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520515007:1":{"text":"When someone passes away, their family and the priests will pick a tree or a clearing.","source_cn":"树葬的流程是：逝者死去后，由亲属与巫祭们共同指定一棵树...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4D4433E030D61D58","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"When someone passes away, their family and the priests will pick a tree or a clearing.","female":"When someone passes away, their family and the priests will pick a tree or a clearing.","variant_male_record_index":"184983","variant_female_record_index":"184984","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520515008:0":{"text":"The deceased's body will be buried underneath a tree, or a seed will be planted at the burial site.","source_cn":"将尸体埋入树下，或在埋葬尸体时放上一颗树种。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF5C30969492B7537","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The deceased's body will be buried underneath a tree, or a seed will be planted at the burial site.","female":"The deceased's body will be buried underneath a tree, or a seed will be planted at the burial site.","variant_male_record_index":"184985","variant_female_record_index":"184986","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1520515009:0":{"text":"In this way, the deceased becomes part of the forest. Whenever the wind stirs the leaves, it is as if they are speaking to us.","source_cn":"最后，逝者会成为丛林的一部分。风吹过树叶时，他们就在对...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCF3D4D9CE0DA28DA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"In this way, the deceased becomes part of the forest. Whenever the wind stirs the leaves, it is as if they are speaking to us.","female":"In this way, the deceased becomes part of the forest. Whenever the wind stirs the leaves, it is as if they are speaking to us.","variant_male_record_index":"184987","variant_female_record_index":"184988","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1520515010:0":{"text":"Besides the burial, we must also hold a ritual at the Primal Shrine.","source_cn":"此外，还要在狩猎神的神殿前为战士们举行一次祭祀仪式。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7555D4CC74E55D8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1520515011:0":{"text":"It serves to provide solace to the fallen souls and guide them back to the goddess' embrace.","source_cn":"以此来告慰死去的族人，让他们的魂灵能够回归神明的怀抱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAEB0D61BEFF1E6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1520515012:0":{"text":"But... our goddess is no more!","source_cn":"但是……哼，雅库伯尔信仰的神明已经不在了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBD3CA2C1C11B031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1520515012":{"text":"But... our goddess is no more!","source_cn":"但是……哼，雅库伯尔信仰的神明已经不在了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBD3CA2C1C11B031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1520515013:0":{"text":"No matter what, the ritual must be held.","source_cn":"无论如何，祭祀仪式必须保留。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43822DB01554EA8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1520515014:0":{"text":"The Hunting Goddess once gave us an artifact that could deliver the last words of the dead to their family. With the goddess gone, the artifact no longer works.","source_cn":"狩猎神曾赐下神器，能将雅库伯尔死者最后的话语传递给亲人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA273F7597DA72070","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1520515015:0":{"text":"But the ritual isn't for the dead; it's for the living too. They need a chance to say farewell!","source_cn":"但是那仪式不仅是为了死去的战士，也是为了还活着的人。他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED84B3286A96CBDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1520515016:0":{"text":"Do we have enough people to handle the tree burials and ritual?","source_cn":"树葬和仪式的人手？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE78E2FD7B450779","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1520515017:0":{"text":"No. Most of our priests have perished.","source_cn":"没有。大部分祭司都牺牲了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x637C80B54B689AF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1520515018:0":{"text":"Straight to the point—I like it.","source_cn":"简单直接，我喜欢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A0F0F90D70E88DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1520515019:0":{"text":"So, you're insisting on both the tree burials and the ritual?","source_cn":"所以你们不但坚持树葬，还一定要举办祭祀仪式？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAD89426AD63A22D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1520515020:0":{"text":"Absolutely.","source_cn":"必须。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16E4C175E147551B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1520515021:0":{"text":"Even though the decayed bodies may lead to a plague? Even though there's no artifact to carry the voices of the dead?","source_cn":"就算尸体腐烂，爆发瘟疫？也没有神器能替你们传达死者的声音？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09476E705E3E141C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1520515022:0":{"text":"We'd rather let the beasts take the warriors than burn their remains. Their souls would never return to nature!","source_cn":"你在小瞧丛林。就算喂给野兽，雅库伯尔也绝不会用火烧毁战...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F6A44E02F6170B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1520515023:0":{"text":"Fine, I hear you. Now, not only is the problem still unsolved, but now there's extra work to do. Awesome.","source_cn":"好好好……好样的。不但没解决问题，还有新要求。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C270D2B998F855A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1520515024:1":{"text":"I'll handle things my way, and I hope our paths never cross again.","source_cn":"我会按自己的方式做。永别，别再让我有机会见到你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2B4BBCB464867B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:29:1520515025:1":{"text":"With that, Morgan turns around and walks away...","source_cn":"撂下这句话后，摩根干脆利落地转身离开了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49AE495494C55F67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:30:1520515025":{"text":"With that, Morgan turns around and walks away...","source_cn":"撂下这句话后，摩根干脆利落地转身离开了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49AE495494C55F67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1520515026:0":{"text":"I'll go get him.","source_cn":"我去追。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CC890BDE3162F12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:0:1":{"text":"Wait! Get him back!","source_cn":"等等，让他回来！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x949E9C5FAA2B0A8D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Wait! Get him back!","female":"Wait! Get him back!","variant_male_record_index":"78527","variant_female_record_index":"78528","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:1:2":{"text":"He's going to use necromancy!","source_cn":"他要用亡灵魔法！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBC78AF72777341DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"He's going to use necromancy!","female":"He's going to use necromancy!","variant_male_record_index":"78529","variant_female_record_index":"78530","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"Let's skip the ritual!","source_cn":"省去这个步骤吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7890ED2D0657AA77","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Let's skip the ritual!","female":"Let's skip the ritual!","variant_male_record_index":"78521","variant_female_record_index":"78522","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:1:2":{"text":"We can simplify things then.","source_cn":"简化流程，岂不正好？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC40A39BCDAA381CD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We can simplify things then.","female":"We can simplify things then.","variant_male_record_index":"78523","variant_female_record_index":"78524","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:2:3":{"text":"A fallen god must be slain.","source_cn":"堕神必须陨落，我是在帮你们","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x905F84B4501534E5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"A fallen god must be slain.","female":"A fallen god must be slain.","variant_male_record_index":"78525","variant_female_record_index":"78526","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"What does a tree burial entail?","source_cn":"树葬的具体流程是什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x445BC8D0D4907D71","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What does a tree burial entail?","female":"What does a tree burial entail?","variant_male_record_index":"78517","variant_female_record_index":"78518","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9